THIRD-PARTY DATA
================

src/scanner/data/jurisdiction_places.json

    Derived from the GeoNames geographical database — the `cities500` and
    `countryInfo` dumps — by scripts/build_jurisdiction_gazetteer.py, which
    filters them to three countries, normalizes the place names, and drops
    Ukrainian territories under occupation. The file is therefore a *modified*
    extract, not a copy of the dumps.

