src/scanner/data/platform_icon_hashes.json

    SHA-256 digests of stock favicons served by documentation and hosting
    platforms, mapped to the platform's name, so a project that serves its
    host's icon is not credited with an icon of its own. The file contains
    digests and names only — no image data — and is not a derivative work of
    the icons it identifies.
